<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUN NET PROFIT DOWN IN H1 '97.</title>
<headline>LITHUN NET PROFIT DOWN IN H1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997,</p>
<p>				     (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   30,000	     vs 740,000</p>
<p>    Turnover		     17.16		vs 15.37</p>
<p>    Operating costs	    12.84		vs 7.569</p>
<p>    Gross profit		 4.34		 vs 7.799</p>
<p>    Operating losses	   11,000	     vs profit 1.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     102,000	    vs 925,000</p>
<p>NOTE -- Lithun is a Lithuanian- Hungarian joint</p>
<p>stock construction company listed on the A group of the Vilnius</p>
<p>bourse.</p>
<p>The firm posted 1.08 million litas net profit and 36.57</p>
<p>million litas turnover for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
